===Etymology===
From {{der|sv|non|hǫfuð}}, from {{der|sv|gem-pro|*hafudą}} or {{m|gem-pro|*habudą}}, northern form of {{m|gem-pro|*haubudą}}, from {{der|sv|ine-pro|*kauput-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*kaput-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sv|/ˈhʉːˌvɵd/}}
* {{audio|sv|Sv-huvud.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{sv-noun|n}}

# {{lb|sv|anatomy}} [[head]]; a [[body part]]
# [[head]]; the [[topmost]] part of some things
# [[head]]; the [[end]] of a [[tool]] used for [[strike|striking]]
# [[head]]; the [[blunt]] [[end]] of a [[fastener]]

